{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"TIT","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"提多書","commonName":"提多書","title":"提多書","order":56,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"bbabddaa86a99d07bc8e1504469077e53d4f658ff0ef5ae59a29a031e6c87162","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":46},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["熱心行善"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你要提醒眾人，叫他們順服作官的、掌權的，遵他的命，預備行各樣的善事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["不要毀謗，不要爭競，總要和平，向眾人大顯溫柔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我們從前也是無知、悖逆、受迷惑、服事各樣私慾，和宴樂，常存惡毒",{"noteId":1},"嫉妒的心，是可恨的，又是彼此相恨。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但到了上帝－我們救主的恩慈和他向人所施的慈愛顯明的時候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他便救了我們；並不是因我們自己所行的義，乃是照他的憐憫，藉着重生的洗和聖靈的更新。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["聖靈就是上帝藉着耶穌基督－我們救主厚厚澆灌在我們身上的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["好叫我們因他的恩得稱為義，可以憑着永生的盼望成為後嗣",{"noteId":2},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["這話是可信的。 我也願你把這些事切切實實地講明，使那些已信上帝的人留心做正經事業",{"noteId":3},"。這都是美事，並且與人有益。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["要遠避無知的辯論和家譜的空談，以及紛爭，並因律法而起的爭競，因為這都是虛妄無益的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["分門結黨的人，警戒過一兩次，就要棄絕他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因為知道這等人已經背道，犯了罪，自己明知不是，還是去做。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["個人的指示和問安"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我打發亞提馬或是推基古到你那裏去的時候，你要趕緊往尼哥坡里去見我，因為我已經定意在那裏過冬。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你要趕緊給律師西納和亞波羅送行，叫他們沒有缺乏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["並且我們的人要學習正經事業",{"noteId":4},"，預備所需用的，免得不結果子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["同我在一處的人都問你安。請代問那些因有信心愛我們的人安。願恩惠常與你們眾人同在！"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：陰毒","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":3}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：可以憑着盼望承受永生","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":7}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：留心行善","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":8}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：要學習行善","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PHM/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/TIT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}